+# How to Reposition Your Career
+
+## Concept
+
+A career pivot is visualized as a route correction, not a reset. A continuous gold line travels through existing experience, selects credible evidence, translates it for the destination, and opens a new door.
+
+## Story structure
+
+- **Myth and reframe:** Replace the blank-slate idea with a forward route built from existing experience.
+- **Three proofs:** Alex, Jordan, and Priya each reveal transferable work already present in their careers.
+- **Four-step method:** Clarify, curate, translate, and signal become a memorable route.
+- **Resolve:** The past and desired future connect through one honest through-line.
+
+## Beat count
+
+17 uniquely identified narration beats over 259.55 seconds.
