eat beat-09" id="beat-09" data-beat-id="beat-09" data-track-index="0" data-start="138.65" data-duration="24.4" data-narration="She found the moments she&#x27;d already led informally—coordinating project teams, mentoring colleagues, onboarding new hires. And rewrote her bullets to show it: &quot;Mentored 3 new analysts, accelerating their ramp-up time by 30%.&quot; Her summary became &quot;Emerging people leader with a track record of mentoring, coordinating cross-team projects, and growing others while delivering results.&quot;"><div class="route-node">09</div><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">MID-CAREER MOMENTUM</p><h2>SHOW THE LEADERSHIP</h2><p class="statement">Mentored 3 analysts · 30% faster ramp-up</p></div><div class="proof"><span>EXISTING EXPERIENCE</span><i></i><strong>NEXT ROLE</strong></div></section><section class="clip beat beat-10" id="beat-10" data-beat-id="beat-10" data-track-index="0" data-start="163.05" data-duration="5.65" data-narration="Across all three, the pattern is the same."><div class="route-node">10</div><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">MID-CAREER MOMENTUM</p><h2>ONE SHARED PATTERN</h2><p class="statement">Four moves. One credible story.</p></div><div class="proof"><span>EXISTING EXPERIENCE</span><i></i><strong>NEXT ROLE</strong></div></section><section class="clip beat beat-11" id="beat-11" data-beat-id="beat-11" data-track-index="0" data-start="168.7" data-duration="14.62" data-narration="Clarify your future direction. Know whether you&#x27;re aiming for a promotion, a lateral move, or a role redesign—and what kinds of roles you want to show up on your radar."><div class="route-node">11</div><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">MID-CAREER MOMENTUM</p><h2>01 · CLARIFY</h2><p class="statement">Choose the direction</p></div><div class="proof"><span>EXISTING EXPERIENCE</span><i></i><strong>NEXT ROLE</strong></div></section><section class="clip beat beat-12" id="beat-12" data-beat-id="beat-12" data-track-index="0" data-start="183.32"