ur next move feel obvious to others."><div class="route-node">15</div><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">MID-CAREER MOMENTUM</p><h2>REVEAL THE THROUGH-LINE</h2><p class="statement">Past experience → Next move</p></div><div class="proof"><span>EXISTING EXPERIENCE</span><i></i><strong>NEXT ROLE</strong></div></section><section class="clip beat beat-16" id="beat-16" data-beat-id="beat-16" data-track-index="0" data-start="233.7" data-duration="14.19" data-narration="As you move forward in this track, keep asking: how can I tell the true story of my experience so it clearly points to the roles I want next?"><div class="route-node">16</div><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">MID-CAREER MOMENTUM</p><h2>REFLECTION</h2><p class="statement">How does your true story point forward?</p></div><div class="proof"><span>EXISTING EXPERIENCE</span><i></i><strong>NEXT ROLE</strong></div></section><section class="clip beat beat-17" id="beat-17" data-beat-id="beat-17" data-track-index="0" data-start="247.89" data-duration="11.66" data-narration="That&#x27;s the heart of repositioning—and one of the most powerful ways to open new doors without starting from scratch."><div class="route-node">17</div><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">MID-CAREER MOMENTUM</p><h2>DON’T START FROM SCRATCH</h2><p class="statement">Open the next door</p></div><div class="proof"><span>EXISTING EXPERIENCE</span><i></i><strong>NEXT ROLE</strong></div></section><div class="footer"><span></span></div></main><script>
